# Pairs with TypeOK. The reconciler finalizes an intent whose evidence is
# still undecided, writing a record whose outcome is not one the schema has.
MODULE: AuditReconcilerRecordsWait
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reconciler writes a record for an intent it should still wait on
PERTURBS: Reconcile

--- FIND
          ELSE /\ verdict # "wait"
               /\ finals' = finals \cup {Row(o, verdict, op[o].actor, "reconciler", op[o].secret, op[o].long)}
--- REPLACE
          ELSE /\ finals' = finals \cup {Row(o, verdict, op[o].actor, "reconciler", op[o].secret, op[o].long)}
--- END
